data: {"id": "3e07efac4932430c-thinking-parallel_evidence-1335", "run_id": "3e07efac4932430c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 结果分析\n\n所有首轮工具调用完成。以下是关键事实汇总：\n\n### 1. Pod 状态确认（Describe + YAML）\n- **Pod 当前状态：`Pending`**（`containerStatuses[app].reason=ContainerCreating`）\n- 节点调度到 **node2**\n- 控制器链路：`Deployment/workload` → `ReplicaSet/workload-5b5fc86c8c` → `Pod/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974`\n- 唯一容器：`app`（镜像 `python:3-alpine`），**restarts=0**，未启动过\n\n### 2. Volume 配置（YAML）\n- Pod 定义了一个 volume `input`，类型为 **ConfigMap**，引用名为 **`unavailable-config`**\n- `Optional: false`（即该 ConfigMap 必须存在，否则挂载失败）\n\n### 3. 事件（Events）—— 核心证据\n- **`FailedMount", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789048404712, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

