data: {"id": "3e07efac4932430c-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "3e07efac4932430c", "seq": 1337, "ts_ms": 1789048409622, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3e07efac4932430c-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "3e07efac4932430c", "seq": 1338, "ts_ms": 1789048418167, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.545, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1520, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod 配置引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，导致 kubelet 挂载卷失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount  93s (x35 over 56m)  kubelet  MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-ad67bddfb79f) | 核心直接证据，指明挂载失败的具体原因是引用了不存在的 ConfigMap |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount  11m (x20 over 54m)  kubelet  Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` (fact-cf1fc332950f) | 辅助证据，确认挂载失败具有持续性，并非偶发事件 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` (fact-b6ea2e611933)、`pod.status: Pending` (fact-e6e1a39556a6) | 现象证据，验证容器未启动导致 Pod 处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-c21ce91fcc7f) | 佐证现象，指标层面确认容器处于等待挂载阶段 |\n\n证据 1 和 2 均源于 kubelet 日志，明确将 Pod 的 `Pending` 状态和 `ContainerCreating` 等待原因（证据 4）归因为 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，形成完整的证据闭环。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\nPod 配置引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' (fact-4d34c0c04012/fact-ad67bddfb79f) → 挂载卷失败 (FailedMount) → Pod 状态停留在 Pending / 容器等待挂载 (fact-b6ea2e611933/fact-c21ce91fcc7f) → 应用服务不可用\n```\n\n**根因结论：**\n已确认根因为 Pod 配置错误。Pod 定义中引用了名为 `unavailable-config` 的 ConfigMap 用于挂载卷，但该 ConfigMap 在当前命名空间下不存在，导致 `kubelet` 挂载卷操作持续失败（失败次数超过 35 次，持续时间超 56 分钟）。受此阻塞，容器无法启动，Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态，应用服务不可用。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod 配置引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，导致 kubelet 挂载卷失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount  93s (x35 over 56m)  kubelet  MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-ad67bddfb79f) | 核心直接证据，指明挂载失败的具体原因是引用了不存在的 ConfigMap |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount  11m (x20 over 54m)  kubelet  Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` (fact-cf1fc332950f) | 辅助证据，确认挂载失败具有持续性，并非偶发事件 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` (fact-b6ea2e611933)、`pod.status: Pending` (fact-e6e1a39556a6) | 现象证据，验证容器未启动导致 Pod 处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-c21ce91fcc7f) | 佐证现象，指标层面确认容器处于等待挂载阶段 |\n\n证据 1 和 2 均源于 kubelet 日志，明确将 Pod 的 `Pending` 状态和 `ContainerCreating` 等待原因（证据 4）归因为 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，形成完整的证据闭环。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\nPod 配置引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' (fact-4d34c0c04012/fact-ad67bddfb79f) → 挂载卷失败 (FailedMount) → Pod 状态停留在 Pending / 容器等待挂载 (fact-b6ea2e611933/fact-c21ce91fcc7f) → 应用服务不可用\n```\n\n**根因结论：**\n已确认根因为 Pod 配置错误。Pod 定义中引用了名为 `unavailable-config` 的 ConfigMap 用于挂载卷，但该 ConfigMap 在当前命名空间下不存在，导致 `kubelet` 挂载卷操作持续失败（失败次数超过 35 次，持续时间超 56 分钟）。受此阻塞，容器无法启动，Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态，应用服务不可用。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "3e07efac4932430c-final", "run_id": "3e07efac4932430c", "seq": 1340, "ts_ms": 1789048418177, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod 配置引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，导致 kubelet 挂载卷失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount  93s (x35 over 56m)  kubelet  MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-ad67bddfb79f) | 核心直接证据，指明挂载失败的具体原因是引用了不存在的 ConfigMap |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount  11m (x20 over 54m)  kubelet  Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` (fact-cf1fc332950f) | 辅助证据，确认挂载失败具有持续性，并非偶发事件 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` (fact-b6ea2e611933)、`pod.status: Pending` (fact-e6e1a39556a6) | 现象证据，验证容器未启动导致 Pod 处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-c21ce91fcc7f) | 佐证现象，指标层面确认容器处于等待挂载阶段 |\n\n证据 1 和 2 均源于 kubelet 日志，明确将 Pod 的 `Pending` 状态和 `ContainerCreating` 等待原因（证据 4）归因为 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，形成完整的证据闭环。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\nPod 配置引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' (fact-4d34c0c04012/fact-ad67bddfb79f) → 挂载卷失败 (FailedMount) → Pod 状态停留在 Pending / 容器等待挂载 (fact-b6ea2e611933/fact-c21ce91fcc7f) → 应用服务不可用\n```\n\n**根因结论：**\n已确认根因为 Pod 配置错误。Pod 定义中引用了名为 `unavailable-config` 的 ConfigMap 用于挂载卷，但该 ConfigMap 在当前命名空间下不存在，导致 `kubelet` 挂载卷操作持续失败（失败次数超过 35 次，持续时间超 56 分钟）。受此阻塞，容器无法启动，Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态，应用服务不可用。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 59.2s\n├─ 问题定位: 12.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 38.3s (Evidence 33.4s, RCA 4.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 59.227, "metrics": {"run_id": "3e07efac4932430c", "mttr": {"value": "59.2s", "seconds": 59.233407735824585, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 59233.407735824585, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 55849.764823913574, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 8690.672397613525, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3079.695224761963}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 12375.723600387573, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 3